			<item>
				<title>Folder action to autorename screenshots</title>
				<link>https://miroadamy.com/posts/2014-04-22-autorename-screenshots/</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 22 Apr 2014 11:22:48 +0800</pubDate>
				<guid>https://miroadamy.com/posts/2014-04-22-autorename-screenshots/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;move-the-location-of-the-screenshots&#34;&gt;Move the location of the screenshots&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I do not want to have &lt;code&gt;~/Desktop&lt;/code&gt; polluted with files. Thus&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-fallback&#34; data-lang=&#34;fallback&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;mkdir -p ~/Documents/Screenshots&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;defaults write com.apple.screencapture location ~/Documents/Screenshots&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;killall SystemUIServer&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Test the screenshot - it does it&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;automator-based-auto-rename&#34;&gt;Automator based auto-rename&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Create Folder action for &lt;code&gt;~/Documents/Screenshots&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://miroadamy.com/images/autorename-1.png&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It has 3 actions&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://miroadamy.com/images/autorename-2.png&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-fallback&#34; data-lang=&#34;fallback&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;s/Screen Shots //&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;s/./-/g&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;s/ at /_/&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
